-            Account                         | Debit   | Credit
-            ===================================================
-            Stock Valuation                 | 0.00     | 4.00
-            Stock Interim (Delivered)       | 4.00     | 0.00
-
-            So, on delivering product with different price, We should create additional journal items like:
-            Account                         | Debit    | Credit
